1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 20=

15
00:01:27,950 --> 00:01:28,950
Was that an earthquake?

16
00:01:29,590 --> 00:01:30,670
Why did seeing them

17
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:31,760
make my heart skip a beat?

18
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:34,920
What kind of dream lineup is this?

19
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:37,510
We've been thinking too small.

20
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:42,390
There are plenty of men in the world.

21
00:01:43,070 --> 00:01:43,950
It's not like you can't live

22
00:01:43,950 --> 00:01:44,760
without those two.

23
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:45,310
Exactly.

24
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,080
Take your pick.

25
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,080
Choose whoever you like.

26
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,120
Whoever catches your eye,

27
00:01:49,510 --> 00:01:51,310
I'll help you win him over.

28
00:02:04,430 --> 00:02:06,120
The cool, reserved type.

29
00:02:06,510 --> 00:02:07,230
I like him.

30
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:08,880
A sweet, cheerful guy.

31
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,160
I'll give this one a try.

32
00:02:53,190 --> 00:02:53,830
(He...)

33
00:02:54,150 --> 00:02:55,880
(He stayed here all night
watching over me.)

34
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:57,990
Miss Shutiao.

35
00:02:58,630 --> 00:03:00,550
I spent all night composing
a poem for you.

36
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,160
I've come to present it, if I may.

37
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,040
Just leave it by the door.

38
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:06,790
I wrote the poem on my abs,

39
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,830
so leaving it by the door
might be difficult.

40
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:11,990
It would be better to come inside
and show you myself.

41
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,280
It's barely dawn,

42
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,790
and you're already rushing
to my wife's room.

43
00:03:17,430 --> 00:03:18,920
Are you a rooster eager
to crow at sunrise?

44
00:03:21,310 --> 00:03:21,880
Wife?

45
00:03:22,710 --> 00:03:23,790
If I remember correctly,

46
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,360
Miss Shutiao is single now.

47
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:26,470
And weren't you

48
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:27,710
the one who wrote
the Divorce Agreement yourself?

49
00:03:27,710 --> 00:03:28,200
- You...
- Yes.

50
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,790
He's right.

51
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:35,360
You did write
the Divorce Agreement yourself.

52
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,880
Let's go admire your poem.

53
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,480
We can see it better outside.

54
00:03:41,710 --> 00:03:42,230
After you.

55
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:44,200
You...

56
00:03:47,090 --> 00:03:47,860
You're not going anywhere.

57
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,670
Whatever he has, I have too.

58
00:03:49,940 --> 00:03:51,040
You can only look at me.

59
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:54,360
Only you?

60
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,200
Shen He.

61
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,360
Why do you always think you know best?

62
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,470
You make every decision

63
00:04:03,470 --> 00:04:04,480
and arrange everything yourself.

64
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:05,240
From beginning to end,

65
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,880
have you ever once asked for my opinion?

66
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:09,840
I don't belong to you.

67
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,630
I have a mind of my own.

68
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:11,920
I have my own ideas.

69
00:04:12,030 --> 00:04:13,710
I don't want you deciding
how to protect me.

70
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:15,040
I want you to respect me.

71
00:04:17,830 --> 00:04:18,350
Move aside.

72
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,470
Let go of me. You...

73
00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:29,610
♪A thousand lights can't compare
to your silhouette♪

74
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:31,030
You...

75
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:32,560
Is your hand okay?

76
00:04:34,210 --> 00:04:34,980
It's none of your business.

77
00:04:36,220 --> 00:04:36,820
(Divorce Agreement)

78
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:38,880
Let's separate.

79
00:04:38,890 --> 00:04:41,380
♪I close my eyes
and listen to my heartbeat speak♪

80
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:42,260
(Divorce Agreement)

81
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:46,240
Shutiao.

82
00:04:48,070 --> 00:04:48,910
I was wrong.

83
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,430
You can hit me

84
00:04:51,430 --> 00:04:52,470
or scold me all you want.

85
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,120
Let's stay together,

86
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,390
please.

87
00:04:57,660 --> 00:05:01,140
♪A lifetime of devotion♪

88
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:02,910
When I became a coroner,

89
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:06,080
no one understood me.

90
00:05:07,190 --> 00:05:08,390
Only you did.

91
00:05:09,070 --> 00:05:09,560
You helped me,

92
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,270
stood up for me,

93
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:14,000
gave me confidence,

94
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,350
and kept me safe.

95
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:18,240
What I feel for you
is more than gratitude.

96
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,420
I've fallen in love with you.

97
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:28,880
From now on,

98
00:05:29,630 --> 00:05:31,320
I promise
I'll ask for your opinion on everything

99
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,240
and listen to what you say.

100
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,370
♪Even if the road ahead♪

101
00:05:37,390 --> 00:05:38,350
Whatever you want to do,

102
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,120
I'll help you do it.

103
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,880
Whatever you don't want to do,

104
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:43,350
I'll never force you.

105
00:05:43,750 --> 00:05:44,760
I'll never again

106
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:48,360
make decisions

107
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,680
on your behalf.

108
00:05:51,750 --> 00:05:52,390
Shutiao.

109
00:05:52,950 --> 00:05:54,240
Can we stay together?

110
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:58,070
♪Forgetting the troubles of the world♪

111
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,190
Look at me.

112
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:01,560
Can we please stay together?

113
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,240
Look at me.

114
00:06:06,010 --> 00:06:09,510
♪As time goes by♪

115
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:12,760
♪And all the splendor fades♪

116
00:06:13,370 --> 00:06:16,660
♪As long as you're by my side♪

117
00:06:17,490 --> 00:06:19,230
♪I'll never be alone♪

118
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,200
Just this once.

119
00:06:21,390 --> 00:06:22,480
If you ever dare

120
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,510
make decisions for me again,

121
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:24,150
I...

122
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,240
Does this

123
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,320
count?

124
00:06:38,190 --> 00:06:38,680
No.

125
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:06,470
I made this necklace myself,
using materials I gathered.

126
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:09,200
You gathered them yourself?

127
00:07:09,980 --> 00:07:12,380
(Cheng)

128
00:07:12,630 --> 00:07:13,560
So,

129
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,910
do you like

130
00:07:15,390 --> 00:07:16,470
this gift?

131
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:18,910
Yes.

132
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,080
What are you doing here?

133
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,880
Here to compare notes
on choosing a husband?

134
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,200
If those men came today

135
00:07:37,430 --> 00:07:38,680
to ask you for a chance,

136
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:39,910
then so did I.

137
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,350
I'm here

138
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:43,590
to ask you not to choose anyone else.

139
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:48,560
(Divorce Agreement)
You wrote this Divorce Agreement yourself.

140
00:07:49,510 --> 00:07:51,560
You knocked me out
and left me in the carriage.

141
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,560
You decided how everything would end

142
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:55,440
for everyone without even asking me.

143
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:02,030
And now you're telling me
not to choose anyone else.

144
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:04,600
I don't think you have

145
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,910
any right to say that.

146
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,560
This Divorce Agreement

147
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,510
isn't what you think.

148
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,240
Then what is it?

149
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:18,880
To protect me,

150
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,720
you carefully planned everything

151
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:25,070
and decided

152
00:08:25,070 --> 00:08:26,080
everyone's fate for them.

153
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,880
Duty, loyalty, and honor.

154
00:08:29,830 --> 00:08:31,470
You made every decision on your own.

155
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,590
But did you ever ask
if that was what I wanted?

156
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:43,300
♪My reason is slowly giving way♪

157
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:44,230
I was afraid to ask.

158
00:08:45,390 --> 00:08:46,680
I was afraid you'd say
you didn't want to leave.

159
00:08:47,790 --> 00:08:49,080
I was afraid that if I failed,

160
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,680
the ruthless Third Prince

161
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,320
would spare no one in the manor.

162
00:08:55,550 --> 00:08:56,780
I'd rather have you hate me.

163
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:59,420
♪Trapped with nowhere to retreat♪

164
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,350
I couldn't bear to let you die with me.

165
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,440
Who do you think you are?

166
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,080
What gives you the right
to decide for me?

167
00:09:09,570 --> 00:09:12,830
♪Our hearts beat faster
with every passing second♪

168
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,390
I'm begging you.

169
00:09:13,390 --> 00:09:16,670
♪Breaking down every defense♪

170
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:20,150
♪Our eyes meet without a word♪

171
00:09:20,270 --> 00:09:20,800
Don't go.

172
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:24,040
♪Like an act of redemption♪

173
00:09:25,700 --> 00:09:27,560
You wrote
the Divorce Agreement yourself.

174
00:09:28,630 --> 00:09:29,240
We no longer

175
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,510
have anything to do with each other.

176
00:09:31,250 --> 00:09:32,230
♪In this tender uncertainty♪

177
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,300
♪Whoever speaks first
falls deeper in love♪

178
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:35,300
(Divorce (Marriage)
Agreement (Certificate))

179
00:09:37,220 --> 00:09:38,280
(Divorce (Marriage)
Agreement (Certificate))

180
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:41,890
♪I'd gladly fall into the♪

181
00:09:41,890 --> 00:09:43,700
♪Depths of your eyes♪

182
00:09:47,420 --> 00:09:51,140
(Marriage Certificate)

183
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,400
♪Afraid the dream will fade too soon♪

184
00:09:53,410 --> 00:09:54,310
♪Don't turn away♪

185
00:09:54,420 --> 00:09:55,740
(May I spend this life
by your side, never to part)

186
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:57,300
(The divorce was only a cover,
never what I truly wanted)

187
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,470
This is...

188
00:10:03,900 --> 00:10:04,570
A marriage certificate.

189
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,320
Before I went to Zhuque Forest,

190
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,280
I prepared for both outcomes.

191
00:10:08,630 --> 00:10:09,710
If I failed,

192
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:11,830
this Divorce Agreement

193
00:10:12,790 --> 00:10:14,160
would keep you safe.

194
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,830
If I came back alive,

195
00:10:17,670 --> 00:10:18,440
this marriage certificate

196
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:20,750
was what I wanted to give you.

197
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:21,930
♪In this tender uncertainty♪

198
00:10:21,930 --> 00:10:26,540
♪Whoever speaks first
falls deeper in love♪

199
00:10:28,870 --> 00:10:30,440
You're so full of yourself.

200
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,800
You can't have two
conflicting agreements.

201
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:38,600
♪The lingering warmth grows♪

202
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,550
♪Undeniable♪

203
00:10:56,210 --> 00:10:58,530
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

204
00:10:58,530 --> 00:11:05,730
♪Right now, I just want
to stay by your side♪

205
00:11:05,730 --> 00:11:10,930
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

206
00:11:12,130 --> 00:11:17,170
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

207
00:11:18,530 --> 00:11:23,610
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

208
00:11:24,970 --> 00:11:30,090
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

209
00:11:31,370 --> 00:11:34,730
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

210
00:11:53,490 --> 00:11:56,850
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
